xpress - file.png", "id": "880012964941330", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_880012968274663_4142236958427032935_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7RBxtYQU7aYQ7kNvwEX6fCL&_nc_oc=AdrzghCb3Y1Li6dhq4JGv2atJkJhHcR-gKZn_lAQUOoBTBU9t6GSO0qWFdLqhYt3RIM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCGDJC-GYwzvK61ahYYQ4FU6S3eDS0vG8FXYP4nuh0LEw&oe=6A60AA36"}, "display_name": "Spymaster", "keywords": ["spy", "time", "action", "infiltration", "rewind"], "long_description": "Protocore threatens the world, and only the elite agents of NODE can stop this dangerous corporation's plans. Take on the roles of Agent Mulligan, TIC and OSCR to execute high-risk missions using their secret weapon, the C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., becoming the ultimate **Spymaster!**\n\n\n\u200e\n\n\n**Rewind Time**\n\nManipulate time using the C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., refining each step, each decision to conduct the perfect mission.\n\n{1968748060384564}\n\n\u200e\n\n**Unbroken Momentum**\n\nRun, climb, slide, zipline and shoot your way to safety.\n\n{934506685620409}\n\n\u200e\n\n**Become an Elite Agent**\n\n- Three Spies - Each with their own unique gameplay traits\n- Dynamic Missions - No two missions are alike, from defusing bombs to poisoning villains, each becomes more challenging, requiring a different approach \n- Varied Gameplay - Solve puzzles, shoot bad guys, infiltrate secure locations and jump into moving helicopters!\n\n\n{1420911919252335}\n\n\u200e\n\n**Early Access**\n\nSpymaster is in active development, refining its gameplay and continuing to expand its content throughout Early Access.", "short_description": "Infiltrate Protocore, a global corporation with plans that threaten the world. Command three agents with unique skills, manipulate time using the C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., and combine action and puzzles in immersive VR missions to become a Spymaster! "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1195487899369436", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01_PlanningChallenge.png", "id": "1490114796193047", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823286_1490114799526380_7415860082226191522_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bq3QKJ_3LOAQ7kNvwFKGDjC&_nc_oc=AdoZNd9f9bSL42D3E9NNLreLsENXfsSYLckLNsW0Iuh4fpnKn0wvMh6pRAA4XY5THss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCE1YElf7b3mrLHK13078OKlqYGo5o3Va4Pd64GCPvCTA&oe=6A60A188"}, {"file_name": "02_TrainBomb.png", "id": "973850488686719", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_973850492020052_749007368703399656_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5eG2G2LJDF4Q7kNvwG-VTW5&_nc_oc=AdptFhgEVwKuyZAEIWWUc4ta0WT2YT18xubPfT5CXqIQjnaW9NQx5aOkgiTzvLEXgAQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBOYigosAiJ_G1kCBmcRzUaiKZ1WK7E2aoXz4xwwFLQXg&oe=6A60D416"}, {"file_name": "Arctic01.png", "id": "1449925953011072", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507840145_1449925956344405_7991018526636045973_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DdA6CftM9jgQ7kNvwErBgT0&_nc_oc=Adqn3I37P3vUREMZ70Q-2MTSYgacex-qdUBY9i64tX9O1xoPQ6Y4zRQdpglm030yXUs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDuUmfRgrTbHOVYIqGZo-K7X0n-Sy9wwsFTI68MkiUFHQ&oe=6A60C59C"}, {"file_name": "Casino01.png", "id": "1661604571774642", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1661604575107975_8514850386855160248_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g4yRyPz1KtoQ7kNvwFTEGLJ&_nc_oc=AdrjZQlNsfe28zFuFkMmWYlxRmpLoPX2CJHtbmKMkY5eT_X7DA2YEvHxnBynxgaF9j0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBt3ag3AodoXCQhSA-4ng3FTQhCmHwLtYRduQDGVHUGfQ&oe=6A60B9C5"}, {"file_name": "Venice02.png", "id": "957413720478848", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_957413723812181_1101770632876340370_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X0_8kvwodsYQ7kNvwH8W_we&_nc_oc=Adra7c8_AgDJyuQRkRIrX1h8jbD0X-m3XHAp0Qjn9Owe-8e4dIqtAQXi7hwEu1cprOE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCv-gP0_l-Cykojry5KSdfEZ1pffEtL12O5b6UEMbF-oA&oe=6A60B246"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Spymaster", "keywords": ["espionnage", "temps", "action", "infiltration", "rembobinage"], "long_description": "Protocore menace le monde, et seuls les agents d\u2019\u00e9lite du NODE peuvent stopper les plans de cette dangereuse corporation. Incarnez les agents Mulligan, TIC et 0SCR pour mener des missions \u00e0 haut risque gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 leur arme secr\u00e8te, la C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., et devenez l'ultime **Spymaster** !\n\n\n\u200e\n\n\n**Remontez le Temps**\n\nManipulez le temps gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., en affinant chaque \u00e9tape et chaque d\u00e9cision pour mener \u00e0 bien la mission parfaite.\n\n{1566360997771216}\n\n\u200e\n\n**Une Dynamique Ininterrompue**\n\nCourez, grimpez, glissez, utilisez des tyroliennes et frayez-vous un chemin en utilisant vos armes pour vous frayer un chemin.\n\n{683545624843324}\n\n\u200e\n\n**Devenez un Agent d'\u00c9lite**\n\n- Trois Espions - chacun dot\u00e9 de ses propres m\u00e9caniques de jeu.\n- Missions \u00c9volutives - Aucune mission ne se ressemble : du d\u00e9samor\u00e7age de bombes \u00e0 l\u2019empoisonnement de vilains, chacune devient plus difficile et exige une approche diff\u00e9rente.\n- Gameplay Vari\u00e9 - R\u00e9solvez des \u00e9nigmes, \u00e9liminez des ennemis, infiltrez des zones s\u00e9curis\u00e9es et sautez dans des h\u00e9licopt\u00e8res en mouvement !\n\n\n{1461834032240750}\n\n\u200e\n\n**Acc\u00e8s Anticip\u00e9**\n\nSpymaster est actuellement en d\u00e9veloppement actif, avec un gameplay en cours de perfectionnement et un contenu qui continuera de s\u2019enrichir tout au long de son Acc\u00e8s Anticip\u00e9.\n\n", "short_description": "Infiltrez Protocore, une multinationale mondiale dont les plans menacent le monde. Commandez trois agents aux comp\u00e9tences uniques, manipulez le temps gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., et combinez action et \u00e9nigmes dans des missions VR hautement immersives pour devenir un Spymaster !"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1032290062659348", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01_PlanningChallenge.png", "id": "4292361431026248", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_4292361434359581_4470994930713205742_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jw4-N37_JVkQ7kNvwF-ynpi&_nc_oc=Adp-6veje2oH56S2bU5xZ007fjM-Gl742FL1pyhFwwcXUloEuD8Q_1cawweD6OqkWCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDUmnuwYX8KyCLz5eKinpkJtl4V-9yBgb7xw8kmHe9QNQ&oe=6A60A4AB"}, {"file_name": "02_TrainBomb.png", "id": "2440430976405974", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_2440430983072640_275695806054251422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zykp6ARcPwAQ7kNvwG6rxEC&_nc_oc=AdrMOcjod1jj9CYgn2Kvl6xAVEVIV6TKm9WK3pSLlPjJB2fRJ67fvvnzcdgndxB8NGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCslLcOaPzWx0mL2n55A_AsNh4waqnvsXkPrx8JVbjSww&oe=6A60BCA8"}, {"file_name": "Arctic01.png", "id": "1300606715362437", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314660_1300606718695770_7189013550718665862_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g8Vl_keUioMQ7kNvwHP_wTP&_nc_oc=AdqPyiVxFro85dT4lDAqbB8iE-6i19kfkvA_YFYay3ffllcl9z01q6SfZphxM_LWsag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDGQYKbRBdc-hEnw_7kFxnlho15Efcfn6HSoIbnxzwimg&oe=6A60B0F0"}, {"file_name": "Casino01.png", "id": "836604156184163", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_836604159517496_3809464117522935515_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e_1JYu0WvPQQ7kNvwF9SB_n&_nc_oc=Adr78rPTQHTaAr2vua686FFZfnC_etXt6dPcgS3nvQ6PTCLLyv-SjOAazrLQi3Zw7LM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCqWig_bmodAa8Fty0oUETFUt8-5vML3nfJsmATTGXcLw&oe=6A60B183"}, {"file_name": "Venice02.png", "id": "1296478309284882", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824741_1296478312618215_2950825541445735321_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UMdIXz_5LM8Q7kNvwFgezjT&_nc_oc=Adqa7c3A7uLIxfR7UUxz74vjHIOcughCUoYxOYa73LKlU3Tf4L-YDtakSOvcNTMZ-w4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCY3AzVU8-HYkqbiT-WExpdpUushHEmLgYUAi_ahbDQQw&oe=6A60C2C9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Spymaster", "keywords": ["esp\u00eda", "hora", "acci\u00f3n", "infiltraci\u00f3n", "rebobinar"], "long_description": "Protocore amenaza el mundo y solo los agentes de \u00e9lite de NODE pueden arruinar los planes de esta corporaci\u00f3n peligrosa. Encarna en los agentes Mulligan, TIC y OSCR para ejecutar misiones de alto riesgo con su arma secreta, el **C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E.**, y convi\u00e9rtete en un as del espionaje en **Spymaster**.\n\n**Rebobina el tiempo**\n\nManipula el tiempo con C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E., perfecciona cada paso y cada decisi\u00f3n para llevar a cabo la misi\u00f3n perfecta.\n\n{999960406114253}\n\n**Movimiento constante**\n\nCorre, trepa, desl\u00edzate, usa tirolesas y dispara para abrirte camino con seguridad.\n\n{1731948714891891}\n\n**Convi\u00e9rtete en un agente de \u00e9lite**\n- **Tres esp\u00edas:** cada uno con sus habilidades de juego \u00fanicas.\n- **Enfrenta misiones din\u00e1micas:** ninguna misi\u00f3n es igual a la otra. Desde desactivar bombas hasta envenenar a villanos, cada una se torna m\u00e1s desafiante y requiere un abordaje distinto.\n- **Variedad de mec\u00e1nicas:** resuelve rompecabezas, disp\u00e1rales a los villanos, inf\u00edltrate en instalaciones protegidas y salta hacia helic\u00f3pteros en movimiento. \n\n{2181197446051389}\n\n**Acceso anticipado**\n\nSpymaster est\u00e1 en desarrollo activo, puliendo el juego y continuamente ampliando el contenido mediante el acceso anticipado.", "short_description": "Inf\u00edltrate en Protocore, una corporaci\u00f3n internacional con planes que amenazan el mundo. Encarna en tres agentes con habilidades \u00fanicas, manipula el tiempo con C.A.S.S.E.T.T.E. y combina acci\u00f3n con rompecabezas en misiones en RV inmersivas para ser un as del espionaje en Spymaster."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/1e06831f-b759-4751-9ca4-99cbf88c206b", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "InnerspaceVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.innerspacevr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER", "FIGHTING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "de", "zh_CN", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "36623696467244062"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1227985162063932_1839223545351691675_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YHLFvouBsJIQ7kNvwFAOKiE&_nc_oc=AdrL5MDVRUkxs2osUr2kTRj5q-4Lh1wUgU6SRZiQKw9AWXWzyxmuU2hid8bJjg4FRTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA7gkejKzswBjzxAjtutWtz9onnvrtUUrtHoWZi-SjROw&oe=6A60D6B0"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "di